  "outstanding": [
    "The transverse compact family is constructed in HCR-04 from APW-02 and AGF-03. UQC-01 through UQC-03 supply the smaller unitary covolumes. PSM-01 through PSM-03 give the four-coordinate stabilizer, its left Haar density and the mass of a shell. The compact transverse comparison is separate. ADB-01 through ADB-03 derive the uniform count used for the scalar in a dilated compact set."
